  "title": "Easy Chocolate Chip Cookie Bars",
  "description": "Is it a bar, or is it a cookie? Don't worry about it! Just enjoy these delicious chocolate chip cookie bars packed with pecans and chocolate chips.",
  "authors": [
    "Gary Scott"
  ],
  "date_published": "2008-06-30T19:10:59-04:00",
